# lhde's default programs (docs/SETTINGS.md "Associations"), installed as $PREFIX/share/applications/lhde-mimeapps.list.
# Read by every program that follows the MIME Applications Associations spec (flxp, GIO, xdg-open) when XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP
# names lhde, as lhde-session sets it: after every file of the user (~/.config/mimeapps.list, ~/.config/lhde-mimeapps.list,
# which win) and before the mimeapps.list and defaults.list of its own and later data directories (the distribution's), and
# before any program that merely claims a type. Text types without a default of their own inherit text/plain's in flxp and
# GIO (xdg-open asks for the exact type only).

[Default Applications]
inode/directory=flxp.desktop
text/plain=luxpad.desktop

[Removed Associations]
